window.products.push({"id":252138,"name":"2.43 LB Ceramic Pie Weights Reusable 10mm for Baking Pies, Baking Beans Pie Crust Weights Natural Stoneware with a Storage Box and Net Storage Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81efxQEEBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Blind baking (pre-baking the crust) with our pie weights can help achieve this. Pie weights are essential in the pie-baking process as they prevent the crust from bubbling and shrinking during baking. Many of the pie baking procedures lead to the damaged crust, which poses a challenge to the bakers. For instance, when preparing a fruit pie, the juices may leak and soak the uncooked pie dough while filling, hence a soggy crust. Likewise, some pies do not undergo baking, which demands an already cooked crust. Such pies include custard pies, cream pies, and chiffon pies. Also, at times either the filling or the crust may cook fast than the other making one of the two overcook. While baking the crust, you will need something to hold the crust in a flat position to avoid bubbling that may spoil it. That is why we have the pie weights. 【Great for Blind Baking】 The perfect pie has a crispy, flat crust without bubbles. Easy to use, to make a perfect pie or egg tart shell, just put the weights on the parchment paper over the crust to prevent crust from over expanding and blistering of the cake. 【EASY to Use Pie Weights】 Suitable for all sizes pie pan, cake pan or tart pan. Fill the crust with pie weights until the base of the pie is fully covered, then bake the crust in the oven. Make sure to spread the weights around so they are evenly distributed from the edge to edge, instead of only focusing on the center of the pie.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81efxQEEBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XANADU","source_asin":"B099ZJJ9SS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099ZJJ9SS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099ZJJ9SS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":252139,"name":"President Barack Obama Commemorative Figurine by The Hamilton Collection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619WDQbrU0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"With an inspiring message of hope and change, Senator Barack Obama triumphed in his overwhelming election as the 44th President of the United States. Presenting a stunning collectible Barack Obama figurine commemorating this defining moment in American history. A handsome sculptural interpretation, this landmark Obama memorabilia symbolizes the dawn of one of America's proudest eras. Handcrafted in fine artist's resin and meticulously hand-painted, this exclusive Obama collectible is available only for a short time. Standing on a circular base imprinted with his new title, this Barack Obama figurine stands poised and ready for change, a testimony to the power of democracy in action. Demand will be strong for this hand-numbered limited-edition Obama memorabilia. Don't wait to own your piece of American history. Order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619WDQbrU0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bradford","source_asin":"B002DVTYXI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002DVTYXI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002DVTYXI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
