window.products.push({"id":252141,"name":"Asminifor Bridge Lumber Pillow Covers Golden Gate Bridge Famous Building in California, USA Decorative Throw Pillow Case Cotton Linen Sunset Scene Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MPubppKsL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Asminifor Aims Luxury and High Quality Home Decor Products to Your Daily Life. Features: Material: The Pillow Covers are made of a coarser fabric, nice and thick. This fabric is also soft and pleasant to the touch.The Fabric made of cotton linen material with a brief design and look,Durable and easy to look after. Size: 12 X 20 Inch per pack, included 1pc Pillow Covers WORKMANSHIP: Exquisite Hidden Zipper Closure was Designed for an Elegant Look, HIdden Zipper Design Can be Opened to Around 34-36 CM for Easy Insertion of Cushion. about 1.45 inch seam are done on the two margins to make sure that the pillow will be naturally full all way round after the insert of the core. Please Kindly Note: 1. We offer PILLOW CASE ONLY, the CORE/INSERT EXCLUDED.2. For Manual Measurement's sake, please accept a 1-2cm more or less allowance.3. Printed on ONE SIDE ONLY, and THE OTHER SIDE IS PLAIN--NO PRINTING.4. The printed pillow case my not be identical with the picture online, due to different exposure rate between monitors and naked eyes. Tips to Stuff your Insert: Step1. Get the core ready, open the pillow case on the zipper side, fold the core and put it inside the pillow case to the bottom. Step2. Let go of your hand, make sure that your core has stuffed the corners of the pillow case, then close the zipper slowly to make sure it doest not split. Step3. Slightly flap on your pillow to make sure the core will sit well. Package Content: 1 x Throw Pillow Covers These throw pillow covers are designed for simple style home decor, Asminifor cushion covers is available for different colors so you can match whichever color tone you like will go best with your decors in Living room, Bedroom, Office and Car. Welcome to our store, If you have any question, pls feel free let is know, Thank u and Wish You Have A Happy Shopping Time !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MPubppKsL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asminifor","source_asin":"B07V6RJSN9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V6RJSN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V6RJSN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":252142,"name":"Trendy Tripper Swedish Dishcloth/Sponge Cloth Eco-Friendly Reusable Holiday Christmas Design Little Trees (Green Skog Trees)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PZ2qgK0ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE SWEDISH ECO-FRIENDLY DISHCLOTH: All Swedish Dishcloths sold by Trendy Tripper are made in Europe with natural fibers 70% cellulose wood pulp and 30% recycled cotton fibers. The sponge cloth fabric was invented in 1949 by a Swedish engineer and since then the Swedish dishcloth has been a household staple in most Scandinavian homes. Just lately they have been available in the US. Each Swedish dishcloth will replace 15-17 rolls of paper towel, saving cost and saving our planet. The sponge cloth acts much like a sponge in that it absorbs 15 times its weight in water and is very useful in wiping nearly all household surfaces. The wet sponge cloth is soft like a chamois and is great for wiping up spills or wiping down surfaces in the kitchen and bathroom. Perfect for cleaning refrigerators and refrigerator shelves, stovetops and countertops, even granite. It is also great for washing pans with non-stick surfaces. Many customers even use them for wiping baby’s hands, face and high chairs. Another unique feature is that the Swedish dishcloth dries very quickly which discourages bacteria from growing! This is key to having a clean kitchen. Allow it to dry after use and it should feel clean and not smell like the usual sponges do. The dishcloth is machine washable or you can wash it on the top shelf in the dishwasher. Or pop in the microwave (when damp) for 1 minute. The sponge cloth may be washed a couple hundred times. You can either dry them briefly in the clothes dryer or allow it to air dry. Hang on a dishcloth rail inside the sink where it can dry quickly. When you find that your cloth has reached its life expectancy, toss into your compost heap because it is biodegradable! The possibilities are endless. Customers use these to wipe the boat, do spring cleaning, at the cottage, in your car, for outdoor furniture, in the baby’s room. You will find many different ways for cleaning up with the Swedish dishcloth aka Swedish sponge cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PZ2qgK0ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trendy Tripper","source_asin":"B07XXG8HFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XXG8HFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XXG8HFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
