window.products.push({"id":252147,"name":"HAUSHOF 14 oz Coffee Mug, Insulated Coffee Mug with Handle, Travel Camping Cup, Portable Stainless Steel Coffee Cup, Insulated Coffee Cups with Lid, P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z0aY+l1oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DELAY TEMPERATURE LOSS: Double Wall Vacuum Insulated improves insulation and delays temperature loss; When you drink hot drinks, it won't burn your hand, and it can stay hot for more than 6 hours; When you drink cold drinks, the outer wall of the insulated coffee mug will not frost so it won’t wet the table, keeps cool time more than 18 hours. MATERIAL IS TRUSTWORTHY: 304 stainless steel inside and outside, in line with food grade requirements; This 14 oz coffee mug is one piece stretching without any welding marks, the appearance is smoother, and the feel is more comfortable; The inner wall is smooth and polished, bottom rounded corner design, which is not easy to collect dirt and is easy to clean, 14 oz size also reduces scrubbing time. HANDLE ENHANCES THE USE SENSE: The handle is also made of stainless steel, and the handle design is ergonomic, large or small hands are comfortable holding the insulated coffee cup; Anti-scalding handle, more reassurance to use; In the cold winter, it can bring you steaming warmth, and in the hot summer, it can also get you a refreshing and cold feeling. GREAT TIGHTNESS FLIP LID: The coffee mug is Leak-Proof, and the lid has a great fit with the coffee mug body; The portable coffee mug lid design protects the drinking mouth, is dust-proof and splash-proof, clean and hygienic, and the wide mouth opening allows easy washing and quick filling. (Note: Because the lid seals well if the cup cannot be opened after the hot water is filled, open the plectrum on the lid and release the pressure to open the coffee cup) A VARIETY OF COLORS FOR YOU TO CHOOSE: This 14 oz coffee mug comes in 6 colors - White/Lake Blue/Green/Black/Pink/Navy Blue. The colored coating finish of the mug body is very textured, and it is comfortable to hold and non-slip; The gorgeous colors also make it an excellent choice for holiday gifts. NOTE: In the case of high temperatures in summer or cold in winter, keeping cool/staying hot time will be affected to some extent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z0aY+l1oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAUSHOF","source_asin":"B0BD4N2VY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD4N2VY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD4N2VY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
