window.products.push({"id":252167,"name":"Yoolax Motorized Vertical Blinds Works with Alexa, Light Filtering Remote Control Window Blind Custom Size, Privacy Light Control Slats, Blackout Elec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":329.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817yIy+X6OS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester(100% Blackout) MATERIALS: the V series motorized Vertical Blinds are made of 3.54\" slats blackout fabrics, which can 100% block sunlight. Both sides are the same, which provide UV protection, thermal insulation, and energy-saving. Several colors are available, you can combine the fabric colors by yourself. SMART MOTOR: durable hardwired plug-in motor, please make sure you have a socket nearby. After connecting to a Wifi signal, the smart motor can directly work with Alexa, Google Home, IFTT, and TuyaSmart App. Simply control it manually during power-cut. The motor is put on the right back side default. You can turn around the whole track rod if you want to put the motor on the left side (the motor will be on the front side then). MADE TO ORDER: the Alexa motorized blind is custom made, the max width is 157\", and the max height is 120\". It is capable of both ceiling mounted and side wall mounted. Please leave at least 1.5” width if you install it close to the wall. The motorized shade can be opened from the left or right side. You can customize the running direction. If the width of your blind is over 110\", we will use the extension track (2 tracks connect together). The blind can only open from the middle. LEAD TIME: dispatch in 5-7 working days after getting size confirmation. 5-8 working days for transportation. Each motorized window shade is made to order, can't be sold after a return. We appreciate customer precise measures & careful orders, avoid return without quality issues. Mounting hardware & Install instructions included, very easy to install. Procedures are set before delivery, it can be used directly after installation. WARRANTY & SERVICE: Yoolax offers a 2-year warranty on all our motors and remote controls, during which we will repair/replace them free of charge. Please contact us by Amazon message if you have any questions about the product. We will reply within 12 hours and help solve the problem until you are satisfied. Yoolax provides both blackout and half-shading fabric materials for the remote control vertical blinds. Multiple colors are available and can be combined by yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817yIy+X6OS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoolax","source_asin":"B08THDKCSQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08THDKCSQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08THDKCSQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":252168,"name":"Zerohub Stitching Tassel Tablecloth, Rectangle Wrinkle-Free Dust-Proof Polyester Cotton Table Cover for Kitchen Dining Tabletop Decoration, Green, 55x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SZMvQ71BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Little Fresh And Shine To Your Room Our outstanding highly absorbent and long-lasting Tablecloth is made by skilled artisans with high-quality polyester cotton blend fabric and it can protect the table from stains. And it’s easy to care for too.   Available in square, rectangle shapes, fashioned from simple stripe fabric, this cloth will compliment any table and add tasteful color to your mealtimes.  A backyard picnic, teatime on a terrace, weekend breakfast or formal dinner will all feel more special, more festive and elegant when set with our clean, crisp polyester cotton tablecloths. How to choose the Right-Size Table cloth For Dining Table:  Tablecloth Length=Table Length + 16\"~24\" Tablecloth Width=Table Width + 16\"~24\" each end drops approximately 8\" ~ 12\"  For Tea Table:  Tablecloth Length=Table Length + 8\"~16\" Tablecloth Width=Table Width + 8\"~16\" each end drops approximately 4\"~8\"  Tips: Please measure your tabletop dimensions of length, width before purchasing the tablecloth Care Instruction: 1. Machine washable in low temperature or cold water, gentle cycle 2. Do not bleach 3. Tumble dry on low heat or lay flat to dry 4. Wash dark colors separately   What Are You Waiting For? Click the \"Add To Cart\" Button To Try Your Tablecloth Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SZMvQ71BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zerohub","source_asin":"B089Q74JBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089Q74JBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089Q74JBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
