window.products.push({"id":252188,"name":"GFCC Pack of 10 Gold Satin Table Runner 12 x 108 Inches for Wedding Party Events Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611CS5rGjRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Satin 【What You Get】According to your order, you will receive 1 or 5 or 10 packs satin table runners. The solid color satin table runners suitable for your various occasion needs, not easily be outdated. Satin table runners will bring shinging and more sense of design for your house. 【Premium Satin Fabric】The satin table runners is made of high quality satin material with smooth appearence. Satin table runners also has a natural sense of drooping style, not easy to fade, not shrink thus reusable; the hign quality satin table runners can make your party, wedding attractive and impressive. 【Seamless One-Piece Design】Satin table runners measures about 12 x 108 inches (30CM x 275CM). All sides use overlocked design, the satin table runners is in rigorous style, which has smooth surface without wrinkles and flat and delicate sides. The seamless one-piece design make your satin table runners look classy and elegent. 【Easy to Care】Satin table runners can be hand wash and hang dry. Do Not use dryer for long service life. It' normal that the table runners you received may be a little wrinkle. Spray water on the wrinkles of satin table runners and cover it with a thin towl; then set a iron to lowest temperature and press it gentlely. 【Multi Functional Uses】Satin table runners are suitable for various occasions, such as wedding, Banquet, Engagement, Birthday, Graduation, Baby Shower, Anniversary, party, School grad party, Library eventetc. Satin table runners can be used to decorate your tables or tied in a bow as chair decoration. Besides, the satin table runner can also be used with napkins to decorate tea tables. Satin table runners can make your decorations shine and it's sure to bring the extra surprise and romance!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611CS5rGjRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GFCC","source_asin":"B081J6RY36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081J6RY36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081J6RY36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
