window.products.push({"id":252278,"name":"6.2FT Christmas Garland with Red Berry Pine Cone& 9.8 FT 30 String Lights Lighted Garland for Mantel Doorway Fireplace Table Centerpiece Winter Home N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815el9EDBhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Contains: 1 pcs 6.2 ft Christmas garland and 1 pcs 9.8 ft battery operated string lights. The lighted Christmas garland is very lush and is decorated by 19 green leaves, 59 cute red berries and 7 pine cones. Those lovely decorations will add more fascination to your house in the Christmas. Christmas Garland with Lights: The Christmas garland has 30 lights and Christmas lights is battery operated. You can put the Christmas garland anywhere in your house without looking for a power outlet nearby. It's durable and not easy to damage, can be bent and adjusted to any shape you like, safe and never got hot. High-Quality Material: The Christmas garland' berries and leaves are made of foam and plastic, pine cone are made of wood, realistic and vivid. The lighted Christmas garland is durable, will last many holidays without damage. The grand red and slightly luminous appearance immediately filled any room with a festive and romantic atmosphere. Beautiful Indoor or Outdoor Decor: Elegant Christmas decorations are suitable for outdoor and indoor. Christmas garland with lights are displayed on the mantelpiece or stair railing or on the dining table. It also suitable for outdoor use along the edges of doors and windows. Add glamour to your holidays with this eye-catching garland Christmas decorations. Versatile Christmas Decor: Whether you only need 6 ft Christmas garland for the table, 12 ft wrapped around the Christmas tree, or 24 ft for the stair handrail, this garland Christmas decorations can meet all your demand in any situation. Just combine multiple garlands together to create the desired length. It's a wonderful choice for your Christmas decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815el9EDBhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ouddy","source_asin":"B095H3LTJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095H3LTJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095H3LTJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":252279,"name":"In My Head Im Riding My Bike Coffee Mug (White, 11 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pkfZzOWkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"New Arrival In My Head Im Riding My Bike 11 oz only 12.99 USD. If your mug or gift arrives damaged, we will remake your item for free. This applies to any manufacturer defect, error caused by our printer, or damage while in transit. We stand behind each of our products, and our goal is to ensure that the personalized gifts you create using Zenladen will be a cherished keepsake for your child. Remember to inspect your order upon receipt. Please contact us for assistance if any item arrives damaged or defective.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pkfZzOWkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zenladen","source_asin":"B07GH8W8Z6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GH8W8Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GH8W8Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":252280,"name":"Chile Watercolor Map by Michael Tompsett, White Matte, Black Frame 16x20-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oAsse5ErL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features a colorful watercolor map of Chile. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies after leaving University. After 12 highly enjoyable years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Michael Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. An 11x14 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x20 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a black frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oAsse5ErL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00IPSH6OM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IPSH6OM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IPSH6OM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":252281,"name":"Kitchen Trash Can 13 Gallon Trash Can with Lid, Foot Pedal, Inner Bucket Step Garbage Can, Fingerprint-Proof Stainless Steel Trash Can, Quiet-Close Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lVBthIjxL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【SILENT LID/MUTE DESIGN】This kitchen trash can lid built in deceleration design, and the rubber on the edge of the 13 gallon trash can absorb the noise when the lid closing, excellent silent effect provided a quiet environment for your life. ✅【STUNNING MODERN APPEARANCE】The 13-gallon trash can made of high quality stainless steel and adopts a wire drawing process. Excellent surface treatment shows it extremely shiny. This kitchen garbage can with lid can collect garbage and be used as decoration, half the effort, easily make your room clean and tidy. ✅【13 GALLON/50 LITER LARGE CAPACITY GARBAGE CAN】The kitchen garbage can with lid definitely has the capacity to meet your daily needs, while just taking a small piece of the room. Built-in removable plastic bucket for convenient trash disposal and trash bag replacement. The regular 13-gallon garbage bag in the supermarket can be used in our stainless steel trash can, and it's kind of you to use a bigger bag. ✅【ODOR PROOF/EASY CLEAN】The rubber on the edge of the trash can opening provides an excellent seal against odors from the trash.. This trash can is easy to clean, fingerprint-proof finish resists smudges to keep stainless steel shiny. The dirt on the surface of the garbage bin can be easily removed with only a rag. ✅【USER FRIENDLY DESIGN】 The garbage cans are equipped with a quick response pedal, just lightly press the pedal with your feet and the lid will open, without getting your hands dirty. With ABS hydraulic deceleration technology, the trashcan lid can be slowly and gently closed when the pedal is released, without making noise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lVBthIjxL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MKDLUFEI","source_asin":"B0BMQCYPQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMQCYPQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMQCYPQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
