window.products.push({"id":252383,"name":"DHSBTLS Mason Jars 32 OZ, Glass Jar,Canning Jars Jelly Jars With Regular Lids, Ideal for Overnight oats,Jam, Honey, Yogurt,Wedding Favors, Baby Foods,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714YTIx80cS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SZDHS MASON JARS KEEP YOUR FOOD FRESH WHY TAKE SZDHS MASON JARS? Canning jars keep your food fresh and safe. Preserving your food properly will not leach any chemicals to spoil the food. It will personalize your living space and make everyday chores more doable. MULTI-PURPOSE: You can use these Mason Jars for multiple purposes. They are great for canning, pickling, jelly beans, jams, jellies, drinks, lotions, candles and as an element of interior. REGULAR MOUTH: Regular mouth makes it easy to place plump fruits and vegetables such as beets, pickles, tomatoes etc. into the jar. The opening allows your hand fit inside to clean, simple and easy. AIRTIGHT SEAL: 1 piece lid and band that seals well to prevent any air from entering the jar to preserve its freshness.This makes them perfect for preserving and canning. Safe for refrigerator, freezer and dish washer. BPA FREE & FOOD SAFE BPA Free food safe grade glass. The rust-free aluminum lids are airtight, which means your food stay fresher longer. Refrigerate up to 3 weeks, freeze up to 18-Months, fresh preserve and store up to 18-Months. REUSABLE & DISHWASHER SAFE The mason jar set is made of the highest quality materials for maximum durability and convenience, can use again and again for years!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714YTIx80cS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DHSBTLS","source_asin":"B08S7C2W7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S7C2W7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S7C2W7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":252384,"name":"Elrene Home Fashions Holly Traditions Fabric Tablecloth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915mrijC-GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elrene Home Fashions provides fashionable home decor to suit any decorating taste. Share a meal in style with family and friends with our Holly Traditions Fabric Tablecloth. Perfect for family gatherings or as a Christmas party tablecloth, this classic table cover is sure to impress guests and family alike. Combine it with our matching napkins, table runner, and placemats to add a touch of vintage seasonal fashion and simple holiday elegance to your home.Made from 100% polyester, this tablecloth has a delicately hemmed edge for a polished look and added durability. Its seasonal design includes a colorful print with boughs of holly and winter leaves, with festive ribbon tying them all together on an off-white background. This tablecloth has a wonderful texture and enough weight to lie perfectly centered on your table and is available in a variety of shapes, including round, oval, and rectangle, so you’re sure to find the perfect fit for your table. To keep this cloth table cover looking amazing, simply machine wash and dry it. It’s a lovely way to add a little fashion to your home this holiday season.Established in 1922, Elrene Home Fashions was founded on the principles of quality and guaranteed satisfaction. With the help of our expert artists and designers, we produce high-quality, fashionable home decor for every home and decorating palate. We are 100% committed to our customers and strive to give the very best in all of our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915mrijC-GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elrene Home Fashions","source_asin":"B08NYMC3CH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NYMC3CH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NYMC3CH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":252385,"name":"Ombre Frosted Window Film Privacy Window,Dark Chocolate Healty Foods Brown Color Inspired Design Digital Print Artwork Image Security for Bathroom Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dT2gixvML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specification: 24\"x36\" inch Material: Vinyl Thickness: 0.2mm / 7.8 mil Package Included: 1 x window film Where to use? -The static cling decor window film applies to any smooth glass surface, it can be trimmed or combined to fit any size window. -You can use window films on window glass of living room, bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, and use on front door window, sliding door window, french window, cabinet panel. This window film fits for office, house, restaurant, bar, shop and home etc. Installation Step: 1. Cut film to required size, about 1 inch larger than the window 2. Clean the glass surface 3. Use the spray bottle wet the glass with water, more water more better (JUST WATER, NOT USE GLASS CLEANER) 4. Peel off the back protective film (Sometime you will find it is difficult to tear off the protective film, you can try to tape the two sides with adhesive tape then peel off) 5. Stick film on glass (Put the smooth side to window, don’t put the frosted side to the window) 6. Scrape a few more times with squeegee or abandoned credit cards to ensure the bubbles and water are completely removed 7. Trim the margin and cut off the excess edges Tips: 1. This film is suitable for smooth, flat clean glass surface. Do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other material. 2. Please make sure to peel off the backing film before applying and apply the smooth side of film to glass. Otherwise it will not be firmly adhered. 3. This window film can show the colors when the light is going through or reflected, so usually you can’t see the colors of window film before install. 4. Use a hair dryer to soften the film under cold weather.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dT2gixvML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wendaoblt","source_asin":"B09KXKC51M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KXKC51M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KXKC51M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
