window.products.push({"id":252453,"name":"Gifts for Brothers - 20oz Best Brother Ever Tumbler Gifts for Men - Birthday Gift for Brother from Brother - Cool Gifts for Big Brother - Christmas Gi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fkjE252kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Best Brother Ever Gift for Men - Are you looking for a cool gift for your bro? Our black travel tumbler featuring a flag and funny sayings will meet your need. It's a fun way to tell your brother how great he is in your mind, sure to make him proud and feel happy every day. Great gift for little brother, older brother, brother in law, bestfriend male, or soul brother. Great Gift Ideas for Brother - This is what a freakin awesome brother looks like. Printed with the emotional sentences on the front and back, and combined with the unique surface texture design, the stuff will always remind him of your appreciation. A meaningful present for brother from sister or brother, also for adult man or teen boy from a male friend. Special gift for birthday, anniversary, father's day, Valentines, Christmas, Thanksgiving, etc. Tumbler Gift for All Occasions - The tumbler is suitable for brothers of all ages for indoor or outdoor use. Perfect for drinking some things at home, at the office, at parties, by the pool, at the beach, camping, hiking, or during a barbecue. Can be used as a water mug, beer cup, iced coffee tumbler, wine tumbler, and more. Sturdy and Durable - Constructed from food-grade 304 stainless steel, the double-wall vacuum travel tumbler with BPA-free clear airtight lids, features a seamless lining process. Sweat-proof, durable, and reusable. Can be used to hold hot or cold drinks. Light Weight and Compact - This 20oz tumbler measures approximately 7\" tall with a 3.5\" lip diameter. Fits in most cup holders so that it can be taken anywhere, no matter to work, to school, to gym, to travel, and more. The wide mouth is perfect for adding ice and easy to clean. Hand wash is recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fkjE252kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FlyweightZ","source_asin":"B0BNN4F97Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNN4F97Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNN4F97Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":252454,"name":"Ashley Moore Jeweled Compact Mirror - Beautiful Vintage Style Round Design Enamel Finish & Crystal Adorned Flower - Double Sided Mirror with 1X & 2X M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811iQk20tSL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make all of those on-the-go cosmetic touch-ups a little prettier with the help of the Ashley Moore Jeweled Compact Mirror! This gorgeous compact mirror is made to show off your sense of style and treat you to the sight of something sparkly and chic whenever you reach for your makeup mirror. Completely handcrafted, this vintage style mirror is of much finer quality than the mass produced mirrors you'll find elsewhere on Amazon. The Ashley Moore Jeweled Compact Mirror is constructed out of premium zinc alloy and has a sleek polished silver toned frame that catches the eye. The handcrafted makeup mirror is hand painted and features an inlaid enamel flower on its lid. This lovely blossom has a three-dimensional look and is topped off with premium rhinestone crystals. A beautiful pattern is featured on the back to finish the vintage style compact design. As functional as it is fashionable, the Ashley Moore Jeweled Compact Mirror is a double sided mirror that gives you two options for viewing your reflection. One side gives you a standard view, while the other offers 2X magnification for seeing fine details. At 2-3/4 inches in diameter, the folding compact mirror will slip easily into any bag, yet it is as simple to use as any round vanity mirror. A wonderful gift idea for Mother's Day, birthdays, Valentine's Day or any other occasion, the Ashley Moore Jeweled Compact Mirror is guaranteed to impress. If you're not satisfied with the handcrafted makeup mirror within 30 days of purchase, we'll refund your money. Choose your favorte color and treat yourself or a special lady in your life to a gorgeous double sided mirror that will let her powder her nose, touch up her lipstick or fix her hair in style! Order the Ashley Moore Jeweled Compact Mirror today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811iQk20tSL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ashley Moore Collectibles","source_asin":"B00Y3INPIO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y3INPIO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y3INPIO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
