window.products.push({"id":252500,"name":"Qualsen Window Privacy Film Stained Glass Window Film Non-Adhesive Decorative Static Cling Window Film Stained Glass Window Decals for Home UV Blockin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rb8sZqQTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Window film features: adhesive-free static cling window films, vinyl window film not only can removable and reusable, but also easy to position and remove without any residue. (Notice: This window film is only suitable for completely clean, smooth and no smudge glass surface, do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other materials. ) Window film PRIVACY LEVEL:★★★★★. Increase the privacy of your home with window film.No more peeps, it blurs view and provides peaceful and relaxing space for your kids, pets and family. while this window film reduce UV rays entering the room and keep the indoor light soft Window film design concept: window film use glue-free design, classic geometric pattern, classic decoration make your home refresh. This window film is so easy to fix with water just few minutes (tips: soap water would be better).If you don't stick the window film properly, don't panic, just tear off the window film and stick it again. Window film can be cut to the any size what you need. window film can be widely suitable for kitchen, bedroom, bathroom, living room, dining room, office, hotels, front door classroom, lobby, etc. (Please do remember to peel off the backing film before installing the window film) Window film package include: 1 roll of stained glass window film; 1 piece of instruction; 1 piece of professional stainless steel film cutter; 1 piece of stainless steel ruler; 1 piece of cleaning cloth.Satisfied customer service is the goal we have been pursuing. If you are not satisfied with our window film, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rb8sZqQTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qualsen","source_asin":"B07VH35MMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VH35MMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VH35MMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
