window.products.push({"id":252524,"name":"HAOK Plush Shaggy Duvet Cover Set - 5 Pieces Faux Fur Fluffy Bed Sets (1 Shaggy Duvet Cover + 2 Shaggy Pillow Shams + 2 Pillowcases), Crystal Velvet F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ers2a-jtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxury & Comfort – Knitted with high pile shaggy microfiber reverse to super soft crystal velvet mink, this luxury plush shaggy duvet cover set creates a plush, cozy feel and adds a delightful color to your bedroom. The faux fur comforter cover is silky soft and comfort, you will feel relaxed and fancy taking into a good dream. 5-Piece Value King Duvet Cover Bed Set – This fuzzy fluffy duvet cover set contains 2-PIECE 20”x36” brushed MICROFIBER PILLOWCASES, 2-PIECE 20”x40” faux fur PILLOW SHAMS and 1 PIECE faux fur reverse with super soft crystal velvet fleece DUVET COVER. Corner ties can hold your comforter insert stay in place. All Seasons Choice - The faux fur reverse to crystal velvet pillow shams are plush and comfort which is good for Autumn and Winter, while the brushed microfiber pillowcases are soft and smooth, which is good for Spring and Summer. Whether warm or cold, the bedding sets can offer you different senses of softness and temp to improve your sleep. Easy Care - Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle. Tumble dry low or dry flat. Do not bleach. Do not Iron. Avoid hanging dry, and comb the fleece to regain fluffiness and smoothness after washing. We engineered our signature vacuum packing technique. To achieve maximum fluffiness, tumble dry the duvet cover on a low heat setting for 30 mins. Best Service - Manufactured from world's leading factory, we appreciate you love our faux fur bedding that we offer a 30-day return and replacement service. If you have any questions, please contact us directly to get a satisfied solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ers2a-jtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAOK","source_asin":"B08H4SRFK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H4SRFK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H4SRFK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
