window.products.push({"id":252803,"name":"Marina Decoration Solid Embossed Pinsonic Coverlet Bedspread Ultra Soft 3 Piece Summer Quilt Set with 2 Quilted Shams, Taupe Color King Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KdLAozURL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size Available: Twin Size Included 1 Quilt - 68 x 90 Inch and 1 Pillow Sham - 20 x 30 + 2 Inch;Queen Size Included 1 Quilt - 92 x 94 Inch and 2 Pillow Shams - 20 x 30 + 2 Inch;King Size Included 1 Quilt - 106 x 94 Inch and 2 Pillow Shams - 20 x 40 + 2 Inch. All Season Comfort in Design Lightweight Softness and Cozy. This Oversized Traditional Luxurious High-Quality Printed Quilt is a Great All Year-Round Blanket. It is Light Enough to be Used in Warmer Weather, but also Holds Its Own on a Chilly Night. It’s a Perfect Stylish Quilt to Keep Your Body Warm and Stress-Free. The Quilt is not Too Thick, and the Weight is not too Heavy to Keep You Comfortable and Keep You from Sweating. Durable and Soft Beautiful Emboss Gives Your Bedroom a Classic Charm to Refine Your Bed Both Functional and Fabulous. Pinsonic Embossed Will not Unravel and Allows for Many Years of Continued Use to Make Sure Lasting Comfort and Increased Durability. Textured Detailing and Scalloped Edges add Charm to the Printed Patterns. Super Soft Hypoallergenic Microfiber Print in a Multilayered Technique to Create a Lightweight and Durable Cotton Blend Bedspreads Coverlets Quilts for Year-Round Comforts. Versatile and Gifts This Solid Lush Quilt Set can be Used in the Master Room, Bedroom, Guest Room, Kids Room, Vacation Rustic Home, Cottage, Cabin, Lake House, Mountain House, Cottage, Camping, Home Staging or Lodge Décor. Great Gift to Give to Father, Mother, Husband, Wife, Lover, Family Members or Seniors for Birthday, Mother's Father's Day, Christmas or Any Holiday.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KdLAozURL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marina Decoration","source_asin":"B07S761CVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S761CVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S761CVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
