window.products.push({"id":252816,"name":"Snowball Viburnum Bush - 3 Gallon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bQA8yXGpL._AC_.jpg","description":"Few plants have flowers this large... and you'll get hundreds of them on each bush! Bright white blooms look like cheerleader pom-poms. You'll get flowers in mid spring that last through early summer. The Snowball Viburnum Bush is an easy choice for a decorative or showcase piece. It can also be used in border or foundation plantings, as part of a hedge, or many other landscape designs. The dark green foliage will take on tinges of red or purple in the autumn months. Landscape architects like to group these Viburnums next to colorful azaleas so they can complement each other. They thrive in full or partial sun. These are popular in cut flower arrangements, too. You often see these snowballs paired with hydrangea blooms in vases and bouquets. The Snowball Viburnum Bush begins with an oval shape in its youth, but the branches will spread and arch as the plant matures. It grows best in zones 4-8. Great for bird lovers, too! In the fall, berries appear- attracting a variety of wildlife. This is a fun plant that your neighbors will be asking you about. We send you older plants with well-developed root systems... so you get your blooms now, and not in three years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bQA8yXGpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brighter Blooms","source_asin":"B00AAEQAUU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AAEQAUU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AAEQAUU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
