window.products.push({"id":252895,"name":"Premium Silicone Large Ice Cube Molds with Lid | 2\" Big Shaped Ice Ball Spheres for Whiskey & Bourbon Cocktails | 2 Sets of 4 Round Ice Mold Maker Tra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j8oSP6d1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊 Round Ice Cube Mold - Make perfectly shaped round whiskey ice mold cubes with these large 2\" Ice Trays for Freezer. Slow-melting cubes cool drinks quickly and last long enough to pour other beverages over them. 😍 Easy to Use and Clean - These top-quality silicone molds, ice ball maker mold, are approved and BPA-free. The flexible material makes the ice cube tray with lid easy to pop ice out of the mold, and the lid provides an extra layer of safety. 🥃 Perfect for Whiskey and Bourbon - These large ice cube molds are perfect for whiskey and bourbon cocktails. The large cubes and sphere ice cube mold pop out perfectly with no broken shards of ice, making your drinks look and taste better. 🧊 Versatile Ice Tray - Not just for making ice, this non-stick tray can also be used for freezing juice, tea, or coffee for undiluted cold drinks. This ball ice cube mold is even oven-safe, so you can use it as a candy mold or chocolate mold. 🍹 Cocktail Ice Cube Molds - These ice cube molds for cocktails are perfect. The ice trays for freezer with lid forms big round sphere molds create the perfect amount of ice for your glass, and the slow-melting cubes won't water down your drink.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j8oSP6d1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Group Vertical","source_asin":"B0BS43RMLH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS43RMLH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS43RMLH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":252896,"name":"Monarch Specialties 7613 Computer Desk, Home Office, Corner, Left, Right Set-up, Storage Drawers, 70\" L, L Shape, Work, Laptop, Metal, Laminate, Natur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":438.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510FS4TUgvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you've dreamt of having a corner office at work, this computer desk might be the next best thing. The extra-large, L-shaped desktop offers plenty of room for monitors, a lamp, and more. The 1.5-inch thick desktop has a special design that makes it appear as if it is floating and allows the tops of the 2 drawer units to be used as additional surfaces. For flexibility, the drawer units [one with 2 small drawers, the other with 1 large drawer for hanging files] are reversible and can be installed on either side according to your preference. Generous space between the drawer units offers room to easily move an office chair from one side of the desktop to the other. This stylish desk will bring a modern look to your home office. The drawer units and desktop are finished in a natural wood-look laminate that is contrasted by the black finish of the U-shaped metal legs. Additional dimensions: Interior of small drawers: 13.5 inches L x 15.25 inches W x 3 inches H Interior of large drawer: 13.5 inches L x 17.25 inches W x 10.5 inches H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510FS4TUgvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monarch Specialties","source_asin":"B08WM42LVN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WM42LVN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WM42LVN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":252897,"name":"Craft Storage Turntable by Modern Retro - The Lazy Susan Art Craft Organizer Storage Bins - Organizers & Storage Containers for Crafts, Scissors, Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k0ikh3ZPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ART STORAGE AND DISPLAY TURNTABLE! You asked, and we delivered - FINALLY, the ONLY rotating lazy susan organizer on Amazon! Everything you need is at your fingertips - just spin, grab and go! Perfect for when the creative juices are flowing and you need the right tools RIGHT NOW. Everyone agrees, rotating craft caddys always create better art! MAKE ART FROM A WORK OF ART: Creative types are drawn to creative things. That’s why these craft storage containers are so funky! The colorful design will light up any office, kids’ playroom, sewing table or even a tired old work desk. Careful though, you may find yourself distracted by inspiration at the wrong times (...like trying to cook dinner, or sleep!) NO MORE CRAMMED DRAWERS: Overflowing storage drawers are a thing of the past. Each 4.13 inch high enamel bucket holds a LOT of stuff: pens, glue, glitter, scissors, crayola crayons! But also makeup, utensils and whatever else you’ve been stashing in your ‘junk drawer’! Perfect for organizing your home, sewing desk, craft room or classroom organization ALWAYS MAKES YOU SMILE: Organization and storage doesn’t have to be boring. The Retro Craft Turntable is as FUN as it is functional! We have FOUR bright colors to choose from: Cool Mint, Hot Pink, Aqua Blue or Sunshine Yellow. They’re also made from tough “old school” enamel (not flimsy plastic) so your stuff is always safe! Now, which retro color is your favorite? WITH AN OLD SKOOL GUARANTEE: Forget about 30-Day Guarantees, Back in the good ol’ days things just did their job they way they were supposed to. We’re confident your storage organizer will last the distance, but we give you a one year warranty anyway! So, go ahead, take a trip down memory lane now with Modern Retro… and inspire your modern crafts today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k0ikh3ZPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modern Retro","source_asin":"B07W99J3NX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-252897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W99J3NX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W99J3NX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
